{"id":"33bb5f7820ca84c2","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-coded-well-order.md","title":"df coded well order","display":"df coded well order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-coded-well-order","aliases":["72-df-coded-well-order"],"display":"df coded well order","depends_on":["[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]","[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §3.2.3, print272/PDF284; Simpson §I.6","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-coded-well-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-coded-well-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df coded well order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1a814f5220a079de\" href=\"?note=1a814f5220a079de\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-program\">72-df-primitive-recursive-program</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §3.2.3, print272/PDF284; Simpson §I.6"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,R\">\\(D,R\\)</span> 是互异集变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{D,R}\">\\(X_{D,R}\\)</span> 是Assertion定义的、避开二者的固定新鲜集变量。配对只使用下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pair}_2\">\\(\\operatorname{Pair}_2\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PairMem}\">\\(\\operatorname{PairMem}\\)</span> 的公式宏，不引入未解释的配对函数或新的集合项。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"xR y\">\\(xR y\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in D\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\">\\(x,y\\in D\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in D\">\\(\\forall x\\in D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\in D\">\\(\\exists x\\in D\\)</span> 是条件量词缩写。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 时捕获避免。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>以下各式均为对象公式的构造，集变量量词只按固定两类变量演算使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,R\\in V_S\">\\(D,R\\in V_S\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\ne R\">\\(D\\ne R\\)</span>；构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prog}_{D,R,x}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Prog}_{D,R,x}(A)\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V_N\">\\(x\\in V_N\\)</span> 是显式输入参数；辅助变量唯一取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y:=x_{\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}\\}}\">\\(y:=x_{\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}\\}}\\)</span>；无下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的兼容缩写取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\">\\(x_0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LO}\">\\(\\operatorname{LO}\\)</span> 中固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=x_0,y=x_1,z=x_2\">\\(x=x_0,y=x_1,z=x_2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WF}\">\\(\\operatorname{WF}\\)</span> 中固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=x_0,y=x_1\">\\(x=x_0,y=x_1\\)</span>；配对宏的辅助绑定变量唯一取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PairVar}(t,u)\">\\(\\operatorname{PairVar}(t,u)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_2(\\varnothing)\">\\(t,u\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_2(\\varnothing)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in V_N\">\\(z\\in V_N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pair}_2(t,u;z):=z+z=(t+u)\\cdot S(t+u)+(u+u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pair}_2(t,u;z):=z+z=(t+u)\\cdot S(t+u)+(u+u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PairVar}(t,u)&amp;:=x_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:x_i\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u)\\}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PairMem}(t,u,R)&amp;:=\\exists\\operatorname{PairVar}(t,u)\\,(\\operatorname{Pair}_2(t,u;\\operatorname{PairVar}(t,u))\\land\\operatorname{PairVar}(t,u)\\in R),\\\\\n\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in R&amp;:=\\operatorname{PairMem}(t,u,R),\\\\\nz=\\langle t,u\\rangle&amp;:=\\operatorname{Pair}_2(t,u;z),\\\\\nx\\mathrel R y&amp;:=(x\\in D\\land y\\in D\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R),\\\\\n\\forall x\\in D\\ B&amp;:=\\forall x(x\\in D\\to B),\\qquad\\exists x\\in D\\ B:=\\exists x(x\\in D\\land B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PairVar}(t,u)&amp;:=x_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:x_i\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u)\\}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PairMem}(t,u,R)&amp;:=\\exists\\operatorname{PairVar}(t,u)\\,(\\operatorname{Pair}_2(t,u;\\operatorname{PairVar}(t,u))\\land\\operatorname{PairVar}(t,u)\\in R),\\\\\n\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in R&amp;:=\\operatorname{PairMem}(t,u,R),\\\\\nz=\\langle t,u\\rangle&amp;:=\\operatorname{Pair}_2(t,u;z),\\\\\nx\\mathrel R y&amp;:=(x\\in D\\land y\\in D\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R),\\\\\n\\forall x\\in D\\ B&amp;:=\\forall x(x\\in D\\to B),\\qquad\\exists x\\in D\\ B:=\\exists x(x\\in D\\land B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LO}(D,R)&amp;:=\\forall x\\in D\\neg(x\\mathrel{R}x)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in D((x\\mathrel{R}y\\land y\\mathrel{R}z)\\to x\\mathrel{R}z)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x,y\\in D(x\\ne y\\to(x\\mathrel{R}y\\lor y\\mathrel{R}x)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prog}_{D,R,x}(A)&amp;:=\\forall x\\in D[(\\forall y\\in D(y\\mathrel{R}x\\to A[y/x]))\\to A],\\\\\n\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R,x}(A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Prog}_{D,R,x}(A)\\to\\forall x\\in D A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prog}_{D,R}(A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Prog}_{D,R,x_0}(A),\\quad\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R}(A):=\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R,x_0}(A),\\\\\nX_{D,R}&amp;:=X_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:X_i\\notin\\{D,R\\}\\}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{WF}(D,R)&amp;:=\\forall X_{D,R}[(\\exists x\\in D\\ x\\in X_{D,R})\\to\\exists x\\in D(x\\in X_{D,R}\\land\\forall y\\in D(y\\mathrel{R}x\\to y\\notin X_{D,R}))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)&amp;:=\\operatorname{LO}(D,R)\\land\\operatorname{WF}(D,R).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LO}(D,R)&amp;:=\\forall x\\in D\\neg(x\\mathrel{R}x)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in D((x\\mathrel{R}y\\land y\\mathrel{R}z)\\to x\\mathrel{R}z)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x,y\\in D(x\\ne y\\to(x\\mathrel{R}y\\lor y\\mathrel{R}x)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prog}_{D,R,x}(A)&amp;:=\\forall x\\in D[(\\forall y\\in D(y\\mathrel{R}x\\to A[y/x]))\\to A],\\\\\n\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R,x}(A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Prog}_{D,R,x}(A)\\to\\forall x\\in D A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prog}_{D,R}(A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Prog}_{D,R,x_0}(A),\\quad\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R}(A):=\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R,x_0}(A),\\\\\nX_{D,R}&amp;:=X_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:X_i\\notin\\{D,R\\}\\}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{WF}(D,R)&amp;:=\\forall X_{D,R}[(\\exists x\\in D\\ x\\in X_{D,R})\\to\\exists x\\in D(x\\in X_{D,R}\\land\\forall y\\in D(y\\mathrel{R}x\\to y\\notin X_{D,R}))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)&amp;:=\\operatorname{LO}(D,R)\\land\\operatorname{WF}(D,R).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>WF是在当前集域内所有非空子集有R极小元的对象公式；ZFC中的真实良基性是另一个元概念。在满ω模型两者一致，在一般Henkin模型不可直接替换。LO只约束D内的关系，域外编码忽略。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"5ae195683ce3beb4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-program","status":"resolved","id":"1a814f5220a079de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D,R","display":false},{"tex":"X_{D,R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pair}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PairMem}","display":false},{"tex":"xR y","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in D\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"D,R\\in V_S","display":false},{"tex":"D\\ne R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prog}_{D,R,x}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V_N","display":false},{"tex":"y:=x_{\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}\\}}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LO}","display":false},{"tex":"x=x_0,y=x_1,z=x_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WF}","display":false},{"tex":"x=x_0,y=x_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PairVar}(t,u)","display":false},{"tex":"t,u\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_2(\\varnothing)","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in V_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pair}_2(t,u;z):=z+z=(t+u)\\cdot S(t+u)+(u+u).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PairVar}(t,u)&:=x_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:x_i\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u)\\}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PairMem}(t,u,R)&:=\\exists\\operatorname{PairVar}(t,u)\\,(\\operatorname{Pair}_2(t,u;\\operatorname{PairVar}(t,u))\\land\\operatorname{PairVar}(t,u)\\in R),\\\\\n\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in R&:=\\operatorname{PairMem}(t,u,R),\\\\\nz=\\langle t,u\\rangle&:=\\operatorname{Pair}_2(t,u;z),\\\\\nx\\mathrel R y&:=(x\\in D\\land y\\in D\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R),\\\\\n\\forall x\\in D\\ B&:=\\forall x(x\\in D\\to B),\\qquad\\exists x\\in D\\ B:=\\exists x(x\\in D\\land B).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LO}(D,R)&:=\\forall x\\in D\\neg(x\\mathrel{R}x)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in D((x\\mathrel{R}y\\land y\\mathrel{R}z)\\to x\\mathrel{R}z)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall x,y\\in D(x\\ne y\\to(x\\mathrel{R}y\\lor y\\mathrel{R}x)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prog}_{D,R,x}(A)&:=\\forall x\\in D[(\\forall y\\in D(y\\mathrel{R}x\\to A[y/x]))\\to A],\\\\\n\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R,x}(A)&:=\\operatorname{Prog}_{D,R,x}(A)\\to\\forall x\\in D A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prog}_{D,R}(A)&:=\\operatorname{Prog}_{D,R,x_0}(A),\\quad\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R}(A):=\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R,x_0}(A),\\\\\nX_{D,R}&:=X_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:X_i\\notin\\{D,R\\}\\}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{WF}(D,R)&:=\\forall X_{D,R}[(\\exists x\\in D\\ x\\in X_{D,R})\\to\\exists x\\in D(x\\in X_{D,R}\\land\\forall y\\in D(y\\mathrel{R}x\\to y\\notin X_{D,R}))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)&:=\\operatorname{LO}(D,R)\\land\\operatorname{WF}(D,R).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3297,"backlinks":[{"id":"b0618eb9c08a1bca","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"语法、$\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{QVar},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{ucl},\\operatorname{Arith}_2(\\varnothing)$ 取 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]；$\\mathsf{ACA}_0$ 取 [[72-df-aca0]]；配对公式与 $\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)$ 取 [[72-df-coded-well-order]]。所有对象语言联结词按该语法的缩写展开。"},{"id":"18fee81c0ec38350","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"树 $T,B,P$、$\\operatorname{Bar}_T,\\operatorname{Prog}_T$ 如 [[72-df-bar-theorem]]。关系版本取 [[72-df-coded-well-order]] 的对象 $\\operatorname{WF}(D,R)$、$\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R}(A)$；A遍历基本L2全部公式，D,R为不自由出现在A中的集变量。"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-162","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-coded-well-order|df coded well order]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-162","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-coded-well-order|df coded well order]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-coded-well-order|72-df-coded-well-order]]"}],"outgoing":["5ae195683ce3beb4","1a814f5220a079de"]}